  "delivered": [
    "The existing independent supplied-matrix converter accepts every NativeString activity label, preserving raw bytes, embedded NUL, invalid UTF-8 and the distinction between six-byte adjacent WTF8 surrogates and a four-byte Unicode scalar. Scalar inputs and prior lossless output bytes remain compatible; exact byte tags are used when scalar JSON cannot round-trip native bytes.",
    "All ordered activities/input_map/output_map storage, exact full-size_t indexes, original/before/after ownership and native normalized copies remain separate. The same single native convert operation and variant controls remain authoritative; no extra native algorithm or cached model is introduced.",
    "The compatibility rich getter net remains available for its lossless domain. Complete nine-field literal Petri storage is the canonical fallback, including all nine transition members, inactive source/sink storage, arbitrary signed arc magnitudes, duplicate endpoints, optional names and sparse/root/detached discovery markings. Signed WorkflowMarkings remain exact.",
    "Seven authoritative byte artifacts expose source matrix, normalized matrix, result, PNML, legacy JSON, literal net constructor and signed markings. The original five scalar artifact constants and old offline envelopes remain readable. Optional exporter bytes remain downloadable even when non-UTF8 or XML-invalid; unavailable display text is not relabelled as an exporter exception.",
    "The discovery-to-converter handoff now supplies the actual complete byte-label matrix without coercion. Exact source/normalized downloads can be reuploaded; complete tables, CSV, selected records, reports, original input/control bytes and result artifacts retain numeric holders and byte metadata. Cancellation/replacement guards protect publication of stale requests.",
    "The existing converter and discovery handoff accept every canonical NativeString matrix label. The UI inspects compatible rich nets or complete literal nets, retains exact numeric holders and offers all seven authoritative byte artifacts independently of the historical five scalar export fields. Native/API/portable/full frontend/build/live checks passed. Browser rendering and the named remaining transport/model-host/strict gates stay open."
  ],
